{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGuardians of Dao\u201d is a wuxia RPG that blends real-time tactics with roguelite deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, you play cards as orders\u2014command martial heroes, draw on divine blessings to empower your cards and builds, and reshape the battlefield amid chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Wuxia] [Deities] [Aliens]\u2014intertwined</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien invasion tears through the jianghu. Gunfire and eldritch corruption crush the old rules of the martial world. As the last heir of Celestial Divination, you will bond with heroes, ally with deities, journey through the main story and layered jianghu events, uncover the truth behind the invasion, and lead everyone to defend Earth\u2014and the last faith of humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=960 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.mp4?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The five great sects are selecting a new Wulin Alliance Leader, and as a small nobody wandering the jianghu, how could you possibly miss such a grand event?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one expected that a sudden storm of fate would change not only your path\u2026 but the future of the entire wulin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a person who knows no martial arts truly become the hero who saves the wulin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/c7327cd5c157357f6e3139264e95fd96.avif?t=1772802602\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=1115 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Bagua to adjust your position, create openings for damage, and unleash satisfying bursts at critical moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/562aefa59724fbf86e15917a04229953.avif?t=1772802602\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=1022 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culinary-and-martial dual-cultivation Dayong Sect, the battle-forged Poyun Sect, the unpredictable Qianji Sect\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions from all corners of the land, each wielding their own unique martial arts, and work together to overcome every obstacle on your path through the wulin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/2036c6bd0154638803654c1bcf599cd6.avif?t=1772802602\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/847776dd7599a5a6cadd345e0cfc1300.avif?t=1772802602\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras_big/847776dd7599a5a6cadd345e0cfc1300.avif?t=1772802602 width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardians of Dao is our studio\u2019s first original title.   We warmly welcome your feedback and suggestions\u2014they help us identify issues early and improve the final release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the early Access, please add the game to your wishlist to support our development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=180 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the early Access version of Guardians of Dao. The full game is actively in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the full release, we plan to add at least the following (and possibly more):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The complete main story and full set of stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 sect chapter storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Deities for Blessings builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 recruitable heroes from different sects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper systems and richer meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More difficulty options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term balance and pacing polish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508510?t=1772802602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/20a36562db261ff2188ed86b84e2f3de36474219/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772802602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/2bc672272ea109d04bf8809c77aa48596c30ca42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772802602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/2bc672272ea109d04bf8809c77aa48596c30ca42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772802602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/e7f0135e0d39e89de32c0fc90447ca5c.avif?t=1772802602\" width=680 height=1286 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGuardians of Dao\u201d is a wuxia RPG that blends real-time tactics with roguelite deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, you play cards as orders\u2014command martial heroes, draw on divine blessings to empower your cards and builds, and reshape the battlefield amid chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Wuxia] [Deities] [Aliens]\u2014intertwined</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien invasion tears through the jianghu. Gunfire and eldritch corruption crush the old rules of the martial world. As the last heir of Celestial Divination, you will bond with heroes, ally with deities, journey through the main story and layered jianghu events, uncover the truth behind the invasion, and lead everyone to defend Earth\u2014and the last faith of humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=960 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.mp4?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The five great sects are selecting a new Wulin Alliance Leader, and as a small nobody wandering the jianghu, how could you possibly miss such a grand event?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one expected that a sudden storm of fate would change not only your path\u2026 but the future of the entire wulin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a person who knows no martial arts truly become the hero who saves the wulin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/c7327cd5c157357f6e3139264e95fd96.avif?t=1772802602\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=1115 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Bagua to adjust your position, create openings for damage, and unleash satisfying bursts at critical moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/562aefa59724fbf86e15917a04229953.avif?t=1772802602\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=1022 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.webm?t=1772802602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culinary-and-martial dual-cultivation Dayong Sect, the battle-forged Poyun Sect, the unpredictable Qianji Sect\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions from all corners of the land, each wielding their own unique martial arts, and work together to overcome every obstacle on your path through the wulin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/2036c6bd0154638803654c1bcf599cd6.avif?t=1772802602\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/847776dd7599a5a6cadd345e0cfc1300.avif?t=1772802602\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras_big/847776dd7599a5a6cadd345e0cfc1300.avif?t=1772802602 width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardians of Dao is our studio\u2019s first original title.   We warmly welcome your feedback and suggestions\u2014they help us identify issues early and improve the final release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the early Access, please add the game to your wishlist to support our development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.poster.avif?t=1772802602\" width=180 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap